<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Improved Insectoids</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_InsectoidSupremacy"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: insectoid mastery -->
            <label>supremacía insectoide</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_InsectMeatEating_Sacrilegious"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: sacrilegious -->
            <label>aborrecible</label>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>More Precepts</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Nomad"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: wanderlust -->
            <label>nómada</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Pacifist"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: nonaggression -->
            <label>pacifista</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/IssueDef[defName="VME_Violence"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: aggression -->
            <label>violencia</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Violence_Acceptable"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: Aggression is just a fact of life. -->
            <description>La violencia es solo un hecho de la vida.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Precepts and Memes</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Death_DontCare"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: extremely irrelevant -->
            <label>no importa</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Trader"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: wealthy -->
            <label>comerciante</label>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Odyssey</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
      <mods>
        <li>Vanilla Fishing Expanded</li>
      </mods>
      <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
        <success>Always</success>
        <operations>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/IssueDef[defName="VME_FishingYield"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: fishing skill -->
              <label>habilidad de pesca</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Fishing_Adept"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Our adoration for the water and all life within has led us to employ new and subtle techniques for catching as many fish as possible.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Gameplay effect:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Adept fishermen will be able to catch additional fish from fishing zones. These &quot;adept fish&quot; will be caught 20% of the time in a stack of 10, increasing the overall yield of fishing. -->
              <description>Nuestra adoración por el agua y toda la vida en su interior nos ha llevado a emplear técnicas nuevas y sutiles para capturar tantos peces como sea posible.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Efecto de juego:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Los pescadores adeptos podrán capturar peces adicionales en las zonas de pesca. Estos "peces adeptos" se capturarán el 20% de las veces en una pila de 10, aumentando el rendimiento general de la pesca.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_Crayfish"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: crayfish (adept catch) -->
              <label>cangrejo de río (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_Crayfish"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw crayfish. Crayfish are freshwater crustaceans resembling small lobsters (to which they are related). Some species are found in brooks and streams, where fresh water is running, while others thrive in swamps, ditches, and paddy fields.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Cangrejo de río crudo. Los cangrejos de río son crustáceos de agua dulce que se parecen a pequeñas langostas (con las que están emparentados). Algunas especies se encuentran en arroyos y riachuelos, donde el agua dulce corre, mientras que otras prosperan en pantanos, zanjas y arrozales.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_ButterFish"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: butterfish (adept catch) -->
              <label>pez mantequilla (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_ButterFish"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw Atlantic butterfish. The Atlantic butterfish is distinguished by its very thin, deep body, resembling a flounder on edge. It earned its buttery name from its high oil content.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Pez mantequilla del Atlántico crudo. El pez mantequilla del Atlántico se distingue por su cuerpo muy delgado y alto, parecido a un lenguado puesto de canto. Su nombre mantecoso proviene de su alto contenido de aceite.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_FreshwaterStingray"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: freshwater stingray (adept catch) -->
              <label>raya de agua dulce (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_FreshwaterStingray"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw freshwater stingray. Freshwater stingrays are one of the only rays inhabiting freshwater rather than saltwater. Though docile animals, they were responsiblein old Earth for more injuries to humans each year than any other Amazonian species.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Raya de agua dulce cruda. Las rayas de agua dulce son de las pocas rayas que habitan en agua dulce en lugar de agua salada. Aunque son animales dóciles, en la vieja Tierra causaban más lesiones a humanos cada año que cualquier otra especie amazónica.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_FlyingFish"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: flying fish (adept catch) -->
              <label>pez volador (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_FlyingFish"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw flying fish. While they cannot fly in the same way a bird does, flying fish can make powerful, self-propelled leaps out of the water where their long wing-like fins enable gliding for considerable distances above the water&apos;s surface.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Pez volador crudo. Si bien no pueden volar como lo hace un ave, los peces voladores pueden dar potentes saltos autopropulsados fuera del agua, donde sus largas aletas en forma de alas les permiten planear distancias considerables sobre la superficie.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_Arapaima"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: arapaima (adept catch) -->
              <label>arapaima (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_Arapaima"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw arapaima. On old Earth, it was among the world&apos;s largest freshwater fish, reaching as much as 3 m in length. It was an important food fish.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Arapaima crudo. En la vieja Tierra era uno de los peces de agua dulce más grandes del mundo, y alcanzaba hasta 3 m de longitud. Era un importante pez de consumo.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_ShortfinMakoShark"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: shortfin mako shark (adept catch) -->
              <label>marrajo dientuso (captura experta)</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="VCEF_ShortfinMakoShark"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Raw shortfin mako shark. A large, predatory shark that lives in the open ocean and is often considered the fastest shark. It is known for its incredible leaping ability and can be observed jumping to extreme heights (out of the water) when hunting.\n\nThis is an adept catch that is caught in addition to other fish. -->
              <description>Marrajo dientuso crudo. Un tiburón grande y depredador que vive en mar abierto y suele considerarse el tiburón más veloz. Es conocido por su increíble capacidad de salto y se lo puede ver saltando a alturas extremas (fuera del agua) cuando caza.\n\nEsta es una captura experta que se obtiene además de otros peces.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
        </operations>
      </match>
    </match>
  </Operation>
